# Lab 8 – SVM Classification

## Aim
To implement and compare Linear SVM and RBF SVM on the AI4I 2020 Predictive Maintenance Dataset.

## Dataset
AI4I 2020 Predictive Maintenance Dataset

## Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Scikit-learn

## Tasks Performed
- Loaded and explored the dataset
- Checked missing values and duplicate records
- Analysed machine failure distribution
- Performed EDA using histograms, boxplots and heatmaps
- Analysed features by machine failure and product type
- Preprocessed numerical and categorical features
- Split data into training and testing sets using stratified sampling
- Implemented Linear SVM and RBF SVM
- Evaluated models using accuracy, precision, recall and F1-score
- Generated confusion matrices
- Compared model performance
- Performed hyperparameter tuning using GridSearchCV
